## Cheat Sheets

### Alpine.js Cheat Sheet
- `x-data`: Initialize component state
- `x-show`: Toggle visibility
- `@click`: Event handling

### HTMX Cheat Sheet
- `hx-get`: Perform a GET request
- `hx-target`: Specify the target element for content updates

### CSS Animation Cheat Sheet
- `animation`: Shorthand for animation properties
- `@keyframes`: Define animation sequences

